  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2020 Indo-Pacific Business Forum, through The Webster Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contract funds the 3rd Indo-Pacific Business Forum, which brings together senior U.S. and regional government officials with business officials to advance the objectives of the Indo-Pacific vision. The forum would be held in Vietnam and include representatives from across the Indo-Pacific.</narrative>
